      "signature": "fn resolve_fill(ctx: &mut ResolveContext<'_>, value: XmlSpan, edges: &[Edge], user_inverse: Affine, viewport: [f64;2], control: &mut dyn WorkControl) -> Result<ResolvedPaint>",
      "contract": "ResolveContext borrows source/tokens + mutable CSS/reference/cache and stop append transaction; ResolvedPaint contains Paint and owned new stops before commit. Local linear/radial href inheritance, stop CSS/currentColor, ordering, spread, focal/radius defaults, bbox/inverse handling unchanged. Pattern classified and sent to planner. Cache keyed complete resolution context, charge all probes/token visits."
